Building and installing playmp3list
====================================

Requirements:
  - mpg123 0.59r or later
  - ncurses (wide-character support recommended for UTF-8)
  - C++ compiler (g++ or clang++)
  - GNU make

Quick build:

    make
    sudo make install
    make clean

For NetBSD curses with UTF-8 support:

    make LIBS="-L/usr/local/lib -lncurses" CXXFLAGS="-O2 -DNCURSES_WIDECHAR"

Uninstall:

    sudo make uninstall

Configuration file:

  cp playmp3listrc ~/.playmp3listrc
  # or: sudo cp playmp3listrc /etc/playmp3listrc

Build options (CXXFLAGS):
  -DNCURSES_WIDECHAR    Wide-character mode (UTF-8 support)
  -DVERSION="\"0.99\""  Version string (piped to --help)
